{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>「旅遊達人」梁芷珮（Christy）憑藉主持 TVB 旅遊節目《潮什麼》系列而深受觀眾喜愛，事業得意之餘家庭同樣美滿。她與老公 Kenneth 結婚 22 年，育有兩子一女，五口之家幸福感滿滿。日前，梁芷珮在社交平台晒出一張大仔 Brendan 與鄭伊健年輕時的對比照，並自揭一段在西班牙旅行時發生的爆笑小插曲！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dd28438a-8b7b-4ad7-865f-6afd5fc11b3b.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026JlCpQ2TtnK1789958532.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dd28438a-8b7b-4ad7-865f-6afd5fc11b3b.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-590\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>Christy 透露，當時一家人在西班牙一間越南餐廳用餐，老闆突然指著他們大喊：「Movie star HK...」，讓 Christy 一度以為自己被當地觀眾認出。正當她準備開口解釋時，老闆緊接著補充說「Young and dangerous（古惑仔）」！Christy笑言：「原來佢係指住我個仔話佢似古惑仔入邊嘅鄭伊健。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-590\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c22ccf37-aa49-4ee6-8556-a860e7628a55.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026wtbWCEgMiF1789958532.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c22ccf37-aa49-4ee6-8556-a860e7628a55.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-590\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-590\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-591\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>事後 Christy 特地翻出鄭伊健 2004 年的專輯照片作對比，發現大仔與年輕時的鄭伊健確實有幾分相似。她更搞笑發問網民：「係我似鄭伊健，定係我老公似鄭伊健？」，吸引大批網民幽默回覆：「應該係你阿公似鄭伊健！」、「你哋有一張全家福佢仲似」，戲謔互動相當爆笑。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-591\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a68ba51a-454d-449d-980f-02c117002b4c.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026g2vwvD8DFV1789958532.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a68ba51a-454d-449d-980f-02c117002b4c.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_ae854ee1b2e91f26-592\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>其實，現年 22 歲的大仔 Brendan 被指撞樣鄭伊健早已不是第一次。Brendan 不僅身材高大、外貌俊朗，更是一名文武雙全的學霸！他畢業於香港大學新聞系，運動表現亦極為出色，不僅曾是高爾夫球港隊代表，其後更成為軟式曲棍球（Floorball）港隊代表出賽，表現相當亮眼。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T03:20:01.384610+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":592,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}